Package: nl-ease
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, x11-xserver-utils
Description: Lightweight night light utility for Moksha desktop
 nl-ease is a lightweight night light application for Moksha 
 desktop, built with EFL. It lets users schedule automatic 
 screen color temperature changes via xrandr, running as a small 
 background daemon with an Elementary-based GUI for configuration.
